## Research notes

- Accessible metadata (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Grok 4 as a proprietary SpaceXAI reasoning model (released July 2025, deprecated in AA view), supporting text/image input and text output, with 256k-token context window and pricing around $3.00/$15.00 per 1M tokens in AA snapshots.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, AIME, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources. OpenRouter page for `x-ai/grok-4` was not accessible in fetched results.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

